{
 "source_page": "https://www.abkgroup.it/en/gardeniaariana/download-area/single-item-picture/tabulae/chevron-genuine-havana/",
 "source": "ABK Group download area, \"Download all (.zip)\" on the colour page after sign-in, downloaded for J on 2026-10-09: TABULAE - CHEVRON GENUINE HAVANA - minimali.zip (15783102 bytes, sha256 6dba4f3d336e551366c1c4cfd1a8a554bd90eefc022296c1e86ab0bda5eccef4).",
 "note": "This download holds one copy of each face. Every site picture was matched to its ZIP file by sha256 (each picture's own download, read in the signed-in browser pane). Pictures that ABK lists twice with identical bytes are used once. Face numbers run 01..n in the site's order. Each picture is one chevron piece with both ends cut on a slant, on white; ABK shows both hands (par-dx-sx). Pictures whose top cut rises to the left are mirrored left to right, so every face has its top cut rising to the right; the app lays that hand and mirrors it in every other band. The white beyond the cuts and the 1-2 px white side margins are filled with the piece's own edge pixels, repeated along the grain, so no white bleeds in when a face is scaled down. Each face covers the piece's 150 x 850 mm bounding box (ABK's pictures are 2% narrower than that; drawn at the tile's width).",
 "resolution": {
  "stored_px_per_mm": 0.6,
  "why": "Chosen by J on 2026-10-04 for Gardenia (see the Anima manifests) to keep the repository small. The app draws floors at 0.26 px per mm and walls at 0.56, so 0.6 loses nothing visible today.",
  "sharper_masters": "The original JPGs are sharper (see source_px_per_mm per face). They are kept outside the repository: J's ~/Developer/material-masters/gardenia/tabulae/ holds the tracking files, and the ZIPs can be downloaded again from the source page with a Gardenia&Ariana account.",
  "to_go_sharper": "Re-export the faces from the masters at a higher px per mm with the same file names; no catalogue change is needed. See docs/architecture/surface-material-tile-faces.md."
 },
 "chevron": {
