  "measured": "Each end's cut runs 317 px along the piece in every one of the 118 pictures (straight-line fits to both cuts, 316.8 to 317.1 px), and the pictures are 3809 px tip to tip for 850 mm: 70.7 mm. The pieces lean about 25 degrees off the band crossing, as ABK's configurator preview (two pieces meeting at a vertical cut) and room photos show."
 },
